Replace QMutex with std::mutex in profile.cpp.
profile.cpp guards the shared deco planner state with a QMutex, used only via
lock()/unlock(). std::mutex has the same interface for those two calls, so the
change is mechanical and keeps the locking semantics identical.

--- a/core/profile.cpp	2026-08-11 20:27:51
